{
  "id": "693",
  "title": "Beijing Time",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2019-06-23",
  "synopsis": "Honda wants to make an appointment with Manager Wang for Section Chief Tanaka.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/1074/c8e413bc23d46e9da1efa589a772f2b39714ad75.mp3?1560417364",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "北京时间\n\n王经理：\n    您好！\n    我们市场部的田中科长想和您在2月18日（周一）北京时间上午10点开一个视频会议，讨论一下我们新一年度的合作计划，不知您是否方便？\n    期待您的回复，祝好！\n\n本田\n2019年2月5日",
    "traditional": "北京時間\n\n王經理：\n    您好！\n    我們市場部的田中科長想和您在2月18日（週一）北京時間上午10點開一個視頻會議，討論一下我們新一年度的合作計劃，不知您是否方便？\n    期待您的回復，祝好！\n\n本田\n2019年2月5日"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Beijing Time"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "王经理：",
      "traditional": "王經理：",
      "pinyin": "wáng jīng lǐ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Manager Wang:"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "您好！",
      "traditional": "您好！",
      "pinyin": "nín hǎo",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Hello!"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "我们市场部的田中科长想和您在2月18日（周一）北京时间上午10点开一个视频会议，",
      "traditional": "我們市場部的田中科長想和您在2月18日（週一）北京時間上午10點開一個視頻會議，",
      "pinyin": "wǒ men shì chǎng bù de tián zhōng kē zhǎng xiǎng hé nín zài 1 yuè 2 rì zhōu yī běi jīng shí jiān shàng wǔ 1 diǎn kāi yí ge shì pín huì yì",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "讨论一下我们新一年度的合作计划，",
      "traditional": "討論一下我們新一年度的合作計劃，",
      "pinyin": "tǎo lùn yí xià wǒ men xīn yì nián dù de hé zuò jì huà",
      "english": "Our marketing department chief Tanaka wants to have a video conference with you on February 18 (Monday) at 10 a.m. Beijing Time."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "不知您是否方便？",
      "traditional": "不知您是否方便？",
      "pinyin": "bù zhī nín shì fǒu fāng biàn",
      "english": "He wants to briefly discuss our new collaboration plan for the year."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "I don’t know whether or not that is convenient for you?"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "期待您的回复，祝好！",
      "traditional": "期待您的回復，祝好！",
      "pinyin": "qī dài nín de huí fù zhù hǎo",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Awaiting your reply, wish you all the best!"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "本田",
      "traditional": "本田",
      "pinyin": "běn tián",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Honda"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "2019年2月5日",
      "traditional": "2019年2月5日",
      "pinyin": "4 nián 1 yuè 1 rì",
      "english": ""
    }
